# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"PDF Arranger merges, splits, rearranges, rotates and crops PDF documents. "
"Everything happens in memory against the pages you can see; nothing is "
"written until you save."
msgstr ""
"PDF Arranger menggabungkan, memisah, menata ulang, memutar, dan memangkas "
"dokumen PDF. Semuanya terjadi di memori pada halaman yang Anda lihat; tidak "
"ada yang ditulis sampai Anda menyimpan."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"It is a front end for pikepdf. Page content is never rewritten — only page "
"order, geometry and composition."
msgstr ""
"Ia adalah antarmuka bagi pikepdf. Isi halaman tidak pernah ditulis ulang — "
"hanya urutan halaman, geometri, dan susunannya."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Baris perintah"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Files given on the command line are opened as one document. "
"<code>--version</code> prints the version and exits."
msgstr ""
"Berkas yang diberikan di baris perintah dibuka sebagai satu dokumen. "
"<code>--version</code> mencetak versi lalu keluar."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py pdfarranger_qt/mainwindow.py
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "Membaca"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The application opens in <b>read mode</b>: a continuous page view for "
"reading the document rather than rearranging it. <b>View ▸ Arrange Mode</b> "
"(Ctrl+E) swaps to the thumbnail grid and back."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi terbuka dalam <b>mode baca</b>: tampilan halaman sinambung untuk "
"membaca dokumen alih-alih menata ulangnya. <b>Lihat ▸ Mode Penataan</b> "
"(Ctrl+E) beralih ke kisi miniatur dan kembali."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Reading shows the document <i>as edited</i>: rotations, crops, deletions and"
" reordering are all applied, so what you read is what you would get if you "
"saved. Page-editing commands are disabled while reading — bookmarks are the "
"exception, and are edited here and nowhere else."
msgstr ""
"Membaca menampilkan dokumen <i>sebagaimana telah disunting</i>: putaran, "
"pangkasan, penghapusan, dan penataan ulang semuanya sudah diterapkan, jadi "
"yang Anda baca adalah yang akan Anda dapatkan bila menyimpan. Perintah "
"penyuntingan halaman dinonaktifkan selama membaca — penanda adalah "
"perkecualian, dan hanya disunting di sini."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The page you are on follows you between the two modes. Switching to read "
"mode opens at the page selected in the grid, the first of them if several "
"are selected; switching back scrolls the grid to the page you were reading, "
"without disturbing what you had selected. With nothing selected, reading "
"resumes where you left off — your place in each document is remembered "
"between visits."
msgstr ""
"Halaman tempat Anda berada mengikuti Anda di antara kedua mode. Beralih ke "
"mode baca membuka pada halaman yang terpilih di kisi, yang pertama bila "
"terpilih beberapa; beralih kembali menggulir kisi ke halaman yang sedang "
"Anda baca, tanpa mengganggu pilihan Anda. Tanpa pilihan apa pun, membaca "
"dilanjutkan dari tempat Anda berhenti — posisi Anda di tiap dokumen diingat "
"antar kunjungan."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The toolbar shows which page you are on and how many there are; type a "
"number into it to jump there, or use <b>Ctrl+G</b>."
msgstr ""
"Bilah alat menunjukkan Anda ada di halaman berapa dan ada berapa halaman; "
"ketikkan sebuah angka di sana untuk melompat, atau pakai <b>Ctrl+G</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>View ▸ Continuous Scroll</b> is on by default; turning it off shows one "
"page at a time. <b>View ▸ Facing Pages</b> puts two pages side by side, the "
"way a book falls open. Both settings are remembered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lihat ▸ Guliran Sinambung</b> menyala secara baku; mematikannya "
"menampilkan satu halaman sekali. <b>Lihat ▸ Halaman Berhadapan</b> menaruh "
"dua halaman berdampingan, seperti buku yang terbuka. Kedua pengaturan "
"diingat."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around a document"
msgstr "Berpindah di dalam dokumen"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"One rule for the arrow keys: <b>the modifier decides what moves</b>. Nothing"
" scrolls the view, Option (Alt) moves the text cursor, Shift extends the "
"selection, Command (Ctrl) jumps to an edge, and Fn — Page Up, Page Down, "
"Home and End — jumps further. None of it changes according to whether a text"
" cursor happens to be on the page."
msgstr ""
"Satu aturan untuk tombol panah: <b>pengubahlah yang menentukan apa yang "
"bergerak</b>. Tanpa pengubah menggulir tampilan, Option (Alt) memindahkan "
"kursor teks, Shift memperluas pilihan, Command (Ctrl) melompat ke tepi, dan "
"Fn — Page Up, Page Down, Home, dan End — melompat lebih jauh. Tak satu pun "
"berubah menurut ada tidaknya kursor teks di halaman."

