"read Command as Ctrl and Option as Alt; the table is the same everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan Shift pada kombinasi Command atau Option untuk memperluas pilihan "
"alih-alih memindah — <b>Shift+Command+→</b> memilih sampai akhir baris. "
"Menambahkan Option membuatnya bekerja per kata alih-alih per karakter. Di "
"Windows dan Linux, baca Command sebagai Ctrl dan Option sebagai Alt; "
"tabelnya sama di mana-mana."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Selecting and copying text"
msgstr "Memilih dan menyalin teks"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag across the page to select text, across page boundaries if you keep "
"going. <b>Double-click</b> selects a word. <b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> copies, "
"<b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> selects the text of the page you are on, and <b>Esc</b> "
"clears the selection. The same commands are on the right-click menu."
msgstr ""
"Seret melintasi halaman untuk memilih teks, melintasi batas halaman pula "
"bila Anda teruskan. <b>Klik ganda</b> memilih satu kata. <b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> "
"menyalin, <b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> memilih teks halaman tempat Anda berada, dan "
"<b>Esc</b> membersihkan pilihan. Perintah yang sama ada di menu klik kanan."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Shift+click</b> extends an existing selection to where you clicked. The "
"end you are moving grows out to a whole word, because a single click is an "
"imprecise way to point at one character; the end you started from stays "
"exactly where you put it. Dragging selects by character throughout, since "
"you can watch it and stop where you like."
msgstr ""
"<b>Shift+klik</b> memperluas pilihan yang ada sampai ke tempat Anda "
"mengeklik. Ujung yang Anda gerakkan tumbuh sampai satu kata utuh, karena "
"satu klik adalah cara yang tidak presisi untuk menunjuk satu karakter; ujung"
" tempat Anda mulai tetap persis di tempat Anda menaruhnya. Menyeret memilih "
"per karakter sepanjang jalan, karena Anda bisa mengikutinya dan berhenti di "
"mana saja."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Clicking on text leaves a blinking <b>text cursor</b>. That is what "
"Shift+arrow extends from, and what the Option and Command combinations above"
" move. It stays where you put it — scrolling, paging and clicking off the "
"page all leave it alone — until you press Esc or open another document."
msgstr ""
"Mengeklik teks meninggalkan <b>kursor teks</b> yang berkedip. Dari situlah "
"Shift+panah memperluas, dan itulah yang digerakkan oleh kombinasi Option dan"
" Command di atas. Ia tetap di tempat Anda menaruhnya — menggulir, berpindah "
"halaman, dan mengeklik di luar halaman semuanya membiarkannya — sampai Anda "
"menekan Esc atau membuka dokumen lain."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Following links"
msgstr "Mengikuti tautan"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Click a link to follow it. Links to a page in the same document jump there; "
"links to the web open in your browser. Hovering over one shows where it "
"goes, which is worth reading before you click: many links in a PDF are not "
"written by its author at all but inferred from the text, so what a link "
"points at is not always what the words appear to say."
msgstr ""
"Klik sebuah tautan untuk mengikutinya. Tautan ke halaman di dokumen yang "
"sama melompat ke sana; tautan ke web terbuka di peramban Anda. Menyorotinya "
"menampilkan ke mana ia menuju, dan itu layak dibaca sebelum Anda mengeklik: "
"banyak tautan dalam PDF sama sekali bukan ditulis penulisnya melainkan "
"disimpulkan dari teks, jadi yang ditunjuk sebuah tautan tidak selalu seperti"
" yang tampak dikatakan kata-katanya."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Only ordinary web and mail links are handed to the system — http, https, "
"mailto and ftp. A document is a file that arrived from somewhere, and "
"anything else it asks to open is refused and reported rather than acted on."
msgstr ""
"Hanya tautan web dan surel biasa yang diserahkan ke sistem — http, https, "
"mailto, dan ftp. Dokumen adalah berkas yang datang dari suatu tempat, dan "
"apa pun selain itu yang ia minta untuk dibuka akan ditolak dan dilaporkan "
"alih-alih dijalankan."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Right-clicking a link offers <b>Open Link</b> and <b>Copy Link Address</b>."
msgstr ""
"Mengeklik kanan sebuah tautan menawarkan <b>Buka Tautan</b> dan <b>Salin "
"Alamat Tautan</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Penanda"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The sidebar shows the document's bookmarks. Click one to jump to it. "
"Everything below is on the sidebar's right-click menu, and every command can"
" be undone."
msgstr ""
"Panel samping menampilkan penanda dokumen. Klik salah satunya untuk melompat"
" ke sana. Semua yang di bawah ini ada di menu klik kanan panel samping, dan "
"setiap perintah dapat dibatalkan."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Add Bookmark Here</b> makes one pointing at the page you are reading, "
"named after whatever text you have selected — so select a heading, then add."
" With nothing selected it is named after the page. <b>Add Child Bookmark "
"Here</b> does the same, nested under the entry you clicked."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tambah Penanda di Sini</b> membuat satu penanda yang menunjuk ke halaman "
"yang sedang Anda baca, dinamai menurut teks yang Anda pilih — jadi pilihlah "
"sebuah judul, lalu tambahkan. Tanpa pilihan, ia dinamai menurut halaman. "
"<b>Tambah Penanda Anak di Sini</b> melakukan hal yang sama, tersarang di "
"bawah entri yang Anda klik."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Rename</b> edits the title in place. <b>Re-home to This Page</b> points "
"an existing bookmark at the page you are on, keeping its title. "
"<b>Delete</b> removes an entry and <i>promotes</i> its children into its "
"place; <b>Delete with Children</b> removes the whole branch."
msgstr ""
"<b>Ubah Nama</b> menyunting judul di tempat. <b>Arahkan Ulang ke Halaman "
"Ini</b> membuat penanda yang sudah ada menunjuk ke halaman tempat Anda "
"berada, dengan judulnya tetap. <b>Hapus</b> membuang sebuah entri dan "
"<i>menaikkan</i> anak-anaknya ke tempatnya; <b>Hapus beserta Anak</b> "
"membuang seluruh cabang."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag entries within the sidebar to re-nest or reorder them. <b>Expand All "
"Children</b> and <b>Collapse All Children</b> open or shut a whole branch at"
" once."
msgstr ""
"Seret entri di dalam panel samping untuk menyarangkan ulang atau menata "
"ulangnya. <b>Bentangkan Semua Anak</b> dan <b>Lipat Semua Anak</b> membuka "
"atau menutup satu cabang penuh sekaligus."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Style</b> sets a bookmark bold or italic, or gives it a colour, as the "
"tree shows."
msgstr ""
"<b>Gaya</b> membuat sebuah penanda tebal atau miring, atau memberinya warna,"
" seperti yang ditampilkan pohonnya."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"A bookmark whose page has been deleted is <b>greyed out</b> rather than "
"removed: its title may still be worth keeping, and you can point it "
"somewhere else with Re-home. Undoing the deletion reconnects it. <b>Delete "
"Dangling Bookmarks</b> clears them all out; it leaves alone any entry that "
"points nowhere on purpose, which is a legitimate way to write a heading."
msgstr ""
"Penanda yang halamannya telah dihapus menjadi <b>kelabu</b> alih-alih "
"dibuang: judulnya barangkali masih layak disimpan, dan Anda bisa "
"mengarahkannya ke tempat lain. Membatalkan penghapusan menyambungkannya "
"kembali. <b>Hapus Penanda Menggantung</b> membersihkan semuanya; ia "
"membiarkan setiap entri yang memang sengaja tidak menunjuk ke mana pun, "
"karena itu cara yang sah untuk menulis sebuah judul."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Bookmark edits are part of the document and are written when you save, along"
" with each entry's colour and style and which branches are left open. The "
"one thing that cannot be saved is a bookmark with no page: there is no way "
"to record “points at a page that is gone”, so it comes back as a heading "
"with its title intact."
msgstr ""
"Suntingan penanda adalah bagian dari dokumen dan ditulis saat Anda "
"menyimpan, bersama warna dan gaya tiap entri serta cabang mana yang "
"dibiarkan terbuka. Satu-satunya yang tidak bisa disimpan adalah penanda "
"tanpa halaman: tidak ada cara mencatat \"menunjuk ke halaman yang sudah "
"tiada\", jadi ia kembali sebagai judul dengan namanya utuh."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Arranging pages"
msgstr "Menata halaman"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages to reorder them. Hold <b>Ctrl</b> while dropping to copy instead "
"of move."
msgstr ""
"Seret halaman untuk menata ulangnya. Tahan <b>Ctrl</b> sewaktu menjatuhkan "
"untuk menyalin alih-alih memindah."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages onto another window of the application to copy them there, or use"
" ordinary copy and paste."
msgstr ""
"Seret halaman ke jendela lain aplikasi ini untuk menyalinnya ke sana, atau "
"pakai salin dan tempel biasa."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Paste As Odd/Even Pages</b> interleaves the clipboard with the document —"
" this is how two single-sided scans of a double-sided original are "
"recombined. If the second scan came off a duplex feeder it will be in "
"reverse order; use <b>Arrange ▸ Reverse Order</b> on it first."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tempel Sebagai Halaman Ganjil/Genap</b> menyelang-nyelingkan papan klip "
"dengan dokumen — beginilah dua pindaian satu sisi dari sebuah asli dua sisi "
"digabungkan kembali. Bila pindaian kedua keluar dari pengumpan dupleks, "
"urutannya akan terbalik; pakai <b>Tata ▸ Balik Urutan</b> padanya lebih "
"dulu."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"To move pages a long way, use <b>Move to Start</b>, <b>Move to End</b> or "
"<b>Move to Page…</b> rather than dragging — in a long document the far end "
"is a great deal of scrolling away. They are on the Edit menu and on the "
"right-click menu, and <b>Move to Page…</b> asks for the number the page "
"should <i>become</i>."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memindahkan halaman jauh-jauh, pakai <b>Pindah ke Awal</b>, <b>Pindah "
"ke Akhir</b>, atau <b>Pindah ke Halaman…</b> alih-alih menyeret — dalam "
"dokumen panjang, ujung yang satunya berjarak amat banyak guliran. Semuanya "
"ada di menu Sunting dan di menu klik kanan, dan <b>Pindah ke Halaman…</b> "
"menanyakan nomor yang seharusnya <i>menjadi</i> halaman itu."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Prefer these to cut and paste for moving. A pasted page is a <i>new</i> page"
" as far as the document is concerned, so any bookmarks pointing at the "
"original are left behind with nowhere to go. Moving keeps the page itself, "
"and its bookmarks come with it."
msgstr ""
"Utamakan itu daripada potong dan tempel untuk memindah. Halaman yang "
"ditempel, sejauh menyangkut dokumen, adalah halaman <i>baru</i>, jadi "
"penanda mana pun yang menunjuk ke aslinya tertinggal tanpa tujuan. Memindah "
"mempertahankan halamannya sendiri, dan penandanya ikut serta."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Stamping and tiling"
msgstr "Mencap dan menyusun"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Page ▸ Add Page Numbers…</b> and <b>Page ▸ Add Watermark…</b> draw text "
"onto the selected pages. Both add a <i>layer</i> rather than rewriting the "
"page, so both can be undone and neither touches the file you opened."
msgstr ""
"<b>Halaman ▸ Tambah Nomor Halaman…</b> dan <b>Halaman ▸ Tambah Tanda "
"Air…</b> menggambar teks pada halaman yang terpilih. Keduanya menambahkan "
"sebuah <i>lapisan</i> alih-alih menulis ulang halaman, jadi keduanya dapat "
"dibatalkan dan tak satu pun menyentuh berkas yang Anda buka."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Page numbers follow the arrangement, not the source document: they are "
"numbered in the order the pages are in now. <code>{n}</code> in the format "
"is the page number and <code>{total}</code> the number of pages, so "
"<code>Page {n} of {total}</code> does what it looks like."
msgstr ""
"Nomor halaman mengikuti penataan, bukan dokumen sumber: penomorannya sesuai "
"urutan halaman saat ini. <code>{n}</code> dalam format adalah nomor halaman "
"dan <code>{total}</code> adalah jumlah halaman, jadi <code>Halaman {n} dari "
"{total}</code> melakukan persis seperti tampaknya."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrange ▸ Pages per Sheet…</b> tiles several pages onto one, in reading "
"order — the printer's <i>N-up</i>. The sheet turns sideways when that lets "
"the pages come out larger, which is why two-up gives a landscape sheet and "
"four-up does not."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tata ▸ Halaman per Lembar…</b> menyusun beberapa halaman ke satu lembar, "
"dalam urutan baca — <i>N-up</i>-nya percetakan. Lembar diputar ke samping "
"bila dengan begitu halaman jadi lebih besar, itulah sebabnya dua per lembar "
"memberi lembar mendatar sedangkan empat per lembar tidak."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Saving a document"
msgstr "Menyimpan dokumen"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Optimize for the web</b> in Preferences lays the saved file out so a "
"browser can show the first page before the rest has arrived. <b>Compress</b>"
" repacks its streams and objects; how much that saves depends entirely on "
"the file, and one full of photographs will barely move."
msgstr ""
"<b>Optimalkan untuk web</b> di Preferensi menata berkas tersimpan agar "
"peramban dapat menampilkan halaman pertama sebelum sisanya tiba. "
"<b>Mampatkan</b> mengemas ulang aliran dan objeknya; berapa banyak yang "
"dihemat sepenuhnya bergantung pada berkasnya, dan berkas yang penuh foto "
"nyaris tak bergeming."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Remove All Metadata</b> is a switch, like Password: turn it on and"
" the next save writes a document with no title, no author and no record of "
"what produced it. Edit Properties greys out while it is on, because there "
"would be nothing to edit."
msgstr ""
"<b>Berkas ▸ Hapus Semua Metadata</b> adalah sakelar, sama seperti Kata "
"Sandi: nyalakan dan penyimpanan berikutnya menulis dokumen tanpa judul, "
"tanpa penulis, dan tanpa catatan tentang apa yang menghasilkannya. Sunting "
"Properti menjadi kelabu selama ia menyala, karena tak akan ada yang bisa "
"disunting."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Viewer Preferences…</b> is how the saved document asks a reader to"
" open it — with the bookmarks showing, two pages at a time, and so on. "
"Readers are free to ignore all of it. The settings are read from the file "
"you opened, so a document that already had them keeps them."
msgstr ""
"<b>Berkas ▸ Preferensi Penampil…</b> adalah cara dokumen tersimpan meminta "
"pembacanya membuka ia — dengan penanda tampak, dua halaman sekali, dan "
"seterusnya. Penampil bebas mengabaikan semuanya. Pengaturannya dibaca dari "
"berkas yang Anda buka, jadi dokumen yang sudah memilikinya akan tetap "
"membawanya."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Repair Document…</b> rebuilds a damaged PDF. It works on a file "
"you pick rather than the one on screen, because the file worth repairing is "
"usually one this application cannot open properly either. It reports what it"
" found before writing anything."
msgstr ""
"<b>Berkas ▸ Perbaiki Dokumen…</b> membangun ulang PDF yang rusak. Ia bekerja"
" pada berkas yang Anda pilih alih-alih yang di layar, karena berkas yang "
"layak diperbaiki biasanya justru yang tak bisa dibuka dengan benar oleh "
"aplikasi ini pula. Ia melaporkan apa yang ditemukan sebelum menulis apa pun."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "Tetikus"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Ctrl + scroll</b> — zoom"
msgstr "<b>Ctrl + gulir</b> — zoom"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Shift + scroll</b> — scroll sideways"
msgstr "<b>Shift + gulir</b> — gulir ke samping"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Alt + scroll</b> — scroll exactly one row"
msgstr "<b>Alt + gulir</b> — gulir tepat satu baris"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Double-click</b> — fit the page to the window, and back"
msgstr "<b>Klik ganda</b> — paskan halaman ke jendela, lalu kembali"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Click and drag</b> on empty space — rubber-band select; keep scrolling to"
" extend it"
msgstr ""
"<b>Klik dan seret</b> pada ruang kosong — pemilihan kotak; teruskan "
"menggulir untuk memperluasnya"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around the grid"
msgstr "Berpindah di dalam kisi"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrow keys</b> move between pages, <b>Page Up</b> and <b>Page Down</b> "
"move a screenful at a time, and <b>Home</b> and <b>End</b> jump to the first"
" and last page. Hold <b>Shift</b> with any of them to extend the selection."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tombol panah</b> berpindah antar halaman, <b>Page Up</b> dan <b>Page "
"Down</b> berpindah satu layar sekali, dan <b>Home</b> serta <b>End</b> "
"melompat ke halaman pertama dan terakhir. Tahan <b>Shift</b> bersama salah "
"satunya untuk memperluas pilihan."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Fit One Page</b> (F) scales so a whole page fits in the window and shows "
"one page per row — use it to work on a single page at a time. <b>Fit "
"Multiple Pages</b> (Shift+M) uses the same scale but lets as many pages sit "
"side by side as the window takes. <b>Fit Width</b> (Shift+F) fills the "
"window across instead, which shows the page wider but taller than the "
"window. Double-clicking the grid toggles Fit One Page on and off."
msgstr ""
"<b>Paskan Satu Halaman</b> (F) menyekala agar satu halaman utuh muat di "
"jendela dan menampilkan satu halaman per baris — pakailah untuk mengerjakan "
"satu halaman sekali. <b>Paskan Banyak Halaman</b> (Shift+M) memakai skala "
"yang sama tetapi membiarkan sebanyak mungkin halaman berjajar sesuai muatan "
"jendela. <b>Paskan Lebar</b> (Shift+F) sebagai gantinya memenuhi jendela "
"secara melintang, yang membuat halaman lebih lebar tetapi lebih tinggi "
"daripada jendela. Klik ganda pada kisi menyalakan dan mematikan Paskan Satu "
"Halaman."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"With pages selected, all three fit the selection rather than the whole "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Bila ada halaman terpilih, ketiganya memaskan pilihan alih-alih seluruh "
"dokumen."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Finding text"
msgstr "Mencari teks"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Find</b> selects the pages that contain the phrase and boxes each hit on "
"the thumbnail, so you can see where on the page it is. The boxes clear as "
"soon as you change the document, since the pages they were drawn for may "
"have moved."
msgstr ""
"<b>Cari</b> memilih halaman yang memuat frasa itu dan mengotaki tiap "
"kecocokan pada miniaturnya, sehingga Anda bisa melihat di mana letaknya pada"
" halaman. Kotaknya hilang begitu Anda mengubah dokumen, sebab halaman yang "
"menjadi acuan gambarnya bisa saja sudah berpindah."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Every shortcut can be changed in <b>Edit ▸ Preferences ▸ Keyboard "
"shortcuts</b>, where they are listed under the menu each one belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Setiap pintasan dapat diubah di <b>Sunting ▸ Preferensi ▸ Pintasan papan "
"tik</b>, tempat semuanya didaftar di bawah menu tempat masing-masing "
"bernaung."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Passwords"
msgstr "Kata sandi"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Opening an encrypted document asks for its password, which is remembered "
"until the document is closed."
msgstr ""
"Membuka dokumen terenkripsi akan menanyakan kata sandinya, yang diingat "
"sampai dokumen ditutup."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Password</b> encrypts the document when it is next saved. It is a "
"switch: turn it on and you are asked for a password, turn it off and the "
"next save is unencrypted. The password is never written to your settings, so"
" it applies to this session only — and if you forget it, the file cannot be "
"recovered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Berkas ▸ Kata Sandi</b> mengenkripsi dokumen pada penyimpanan berikutnya."
" Ia sebuah sakelar: nyalakan dan Anda dimintai kata sandi, matikan dan "
"penyimpanan berikutnya tanpa enkripsi. Kata sandi tidak pernah ditulis ke "
"pengaturan Anda, jadi ia hanya berlaku untuk sesi ini — dan bila Anda lupa, "
"berkasnya tidak dapat dipulihkan."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Berkas"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Settings are stored by Qt in the per-user location for this platform; on "
"Windows that is the registry under "
"<code>HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\pdfarranger</code>. There is no "
"configuration file to edit by hand."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan disimpan oleh Qt di lokasi per pengguna untuk platform ini; di "
"Windows itu adalah registri di bawah "
